{"ref":"BDB, חָסֹן","hw":"חָסֹן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָסֹן</span></big>  <strong>adj. strong</strong>, of the Amorite <a data-ref=\"Amos 2:9\" href=\"/Amos.2.9\">Am 2:9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ כָּאַלּוֹנִים</span>, <em>strong as the oaks</em>); <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶחָסוֹן</span> as subst. <em>the strong one</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.31\">Is 1:31</a>. <span dir=\"rtl\">[חָסַן]</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.18\">Is. 23:18</a>.","next":"BDB, חֲסִין","prev":"BDB, חָסַן"}